48
00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.930
Michael Kantor: What… what do you want this…

49
00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:26.020
Michael Kantor: what do you… what do you want us to convey to the world? What is… what is the brand, the typography, the design, the logo?

50
00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:34.979
Michael Kantor: etc. And how does that… do that? How does that convey these ideas? How does that get people excited?

51
00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:44.559
Michael Kantor: So I think it is a really good idea to start with a brand kit before you develop a whole website.

52
00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:54.970
Michael Kantor: And with a brand kit, you can, essentially, you kind of can work with a designer to do that aspect. That's probably the most important piece.

