00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:59.220
Michael Kantor: Just defining that high, high, high level.

54
00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:13.080
Michael Kantor: How do you use the logo, the trademark, brand mark, typography, spacing, what are some cool measures or unique, elements that should be included, card styles, things like that.

55
00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:22.960
Michael Kantor: You define that first, and then you can kind of go and build everything off of that. Because if you don't do that first step, what kind of happens is

56
00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:35.640
Michael Kantor: you have what I would say is kind of like this, series of, transformer robots on your website, where you go to one page, you go to a different page, and it feels like you're on a whole different website.

